@format 1
@id merge.move-file
@title Move file between merge groups
@area Merge
@entry input
@summary Move a dragged group source to a group-card position; an existing destination copy silently prevents reinsertion after source removal.
@flow TB
@related merge.auto-group, queue.create-merge-work

@alias group = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PGroup

[input] Group file drag begins <input>
- Build a drag payload from a group row @ group.PGroupDragHandle(...)
> drop

[drop] Resolve a group-card position <decision>
- Resolve the target group's insertion index from its file rows @ group.PGroupCardHandle(...)
? "Drag source is no longer in a valid group" > unchanged
? "A target group card accepts the drop" > apply

[apply] Move sources <process>
- Remove the dragged source from its original group before insertion @ group.PGroupCardHandle(...)
- Insert it at the resolved position only when the destination has no matching path @ group.PGroupPathInsert(...)
- Rebuild group cards; an emptied source group remains in the model @ group.PGroupRebuild(...)
> result

[result] Group membership changed <output>
= The source is reordered or moved; a duplicate destination leaves it removed from its source group.

[unchanged] Groups unchanged <output>
= No membership or order changes.
